  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of the action is the promotion of a secure environment for EU investment and business, by promoting European standards in IPR legislation, protection and enforcement. The specific objectives of the action are: 1.To prepare and accompany FTA negotiations and support FTA implementation; 2.To improve the level of IPR protection and enforcement&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
